  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">U20 Summit side events in support of Strategic Sector Cooperation Partnerships and the sustainable cities agenda</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective is to host 1-2 high-level events in connection with the U20 Summit and Sherpa Meeting happening in the cities of Tshwane and  Johannesburg in June and September of 2025. The events will support Denmark&#x2019;s Strategic Sector Cooperation by highlighting partnerships with South African cities and advancing shared priorities on sustainable and inclusive urban development.

As the urban track of the G20, the U20 brings cities and urban issues into global policy and help to establish a forum for cities and their experiences to inform the G20 negotiations. This year, the U20 is under the joint chairship of the cities of Johannesburg and Tshwane - two cities that the Embassy work very closely with on the Water Resilient Cities Program.</narrative>
  </description>
